{"id":"26fb5b9577","t":"Freski w 6A","d":"2026-03-03","c":"face1ab281d6","b":"<p>Klasa 6A ostatnio jest w temacie renesansu, na historii i na plastyce.</p><p>Chcąc poczuć ducha epoki, spróbowała „malować freski” jak Michał Anioł w Kaplicy Sykstyńskiej.</p><p>A tak to wyglądało w praktyce:</p>\n<div class=\"gal\"><img src=\"media/637fec62d862.webp\" alt=\"641526911_122118195207137369_8526217217977653584_n.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\"><img src=\"media/650645959c54.webp\" alt=\"644729587_122119191555137369_7478093598602639386_n.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\"><img src=\"media/447250c42ee4.webp\" alt=\"644825195_122119191267137369_3197623498890995077_n.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\"><img src=\"media/e3052dfa5099.webp\" alt=\"644925814_122119191507137369_3797206004904534849_n.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\"><img src=\"media/90cacc99b2bf.webp\" alt=\"644927370_122119191459137369_7259351542026472865_n.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\"><img src=\"media/5cfa70f4c39f.webp\" alt=\"645670275_122119191405137369_5785060878744548200_n.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\"><img src=\"media/d9f98ad4c9bc.webp\" alt=\"645870849_122119191327137369_7562407675663509956_n.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\"><img src=\"media/637fec62d862.webp\" alt=\"641526911_122118195207137369_8526217217977653584_n.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\"><img src=\"media/650645959c54.webp\" alt=\"644729587_122119191555137369_7478093598602639386_n.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\"><img src=\"media/447250c42ee4.webp\" alt=\"644825195_122119191267137369_3197623498890995077_n.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\"><img src=\"media